# ================= WANDS =================
("Wand of Shoves", "Wand", "Uncommon", None, "This wand has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. As a Magic action, you can expend 1 charge to target a Large or smaller creature you can see within 60 feet. It makes a DC 13 Strength save or is pushed up to 15 feet away from you."),
