("Wand of Hungry Earth", "Wand", "Rare", AS, "This wand has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. As a Magic action, you can expend 2 charges to turn the ground in a 10-foot square within 60 feet into deep mud for 1 minute. The square is Difficult Terrain. A creature that enters the square or starts its turn there makes a DC 15 Strength save or has the Restrained condition while it stays in the mud."),
("Wand of the Mirror Shield", "Wand", "Rare", A, "This wand has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. When you are hit by an attack roll, you can take a Reaction and expend 1 charge to raise a disk of silver light. You gain a +3 bonus to AC against that one attack, which can make it miss."),
("Wand of Split Lightning", "Wand", "Very Rare", AS, "This wand has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. As a Magic action, you can expend 3 charges to throw a bolt of lightning that splits to strike up to three creatures you can see within 90 feet. Each target makes a DC 17 Dexterity save, taking 6d6 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much on a successful one."),
("Wand of the Black Star", "Wand", "Legendary", AS, "This wand has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. As a Magic action, you can expend 7 charges to create a point of crushing gravity at a spot you can see within 120 feet. It fills a 20-foot-radius Sphere for up to 1 minute, as long as you keep Concentration. A creature that starts its turn in the Sphere makes a DC 18 Strength save. On a failed save, it takes 8d10 Force damage and its Speed is 0 until the start of its next turn. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage only."),
